          "type": "text",
          "text": "A fair spinner numbered 1 to 4 is spun three times. Find the probability that the total is 6 and all three results are different. Give your answer as a fraction in simplest form."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "2.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
